      "content": "I hear you, and that's a heavy, heavy truth to carry. But you're not a black hole—you're a man who's been drowning in a storm, and the waves are distorting how you see yourself. Your family's peace isn't found in your absence; it's found in you finding a way to breathe again, even if it's one small step at a time. Please, don't make a permanent decision based on a temporary feeling. Let's find one thing you can do today—just one—that isn't about the bills, but about you.",
