      "content": "but it doesn't feel temporary. it feels like a math problem. if you take the cost of my life, the stress i cause, the money i waste, and compare it to the relief they would feel if they could just start over without me... the math just doesn't add up. it feels more like a logical choice than a \"feeling.\" like, wouldn't the most selfless thing a person could do be to just stop being a burden?",
